runtime_text_editor_retained_bitmap_left_draw
status: passed-static-cargo-deferred
artifact: docs/tests/runtime/text/runtime_text_editor_retained_bitmap_left_draw_preview_20260704.png
artifact_sha256: 92BA6223151A8BC00C68AB6BB6B6ED539D267EC7E673189FFDD25E9909B70E7B

root cause:
- Retained-host glyph layout computed RuntimeTextGlyph.x as bitmap-left placement, but draw_layout_glyph ignored it.
- The draw path used origin subpixel placement plus raster.metrics.x_offset, letting the raster backend reapply a per-glyph horizontal offset after runtime shaping had already positioned the label.

fix:
- draw/glyphs.rs keeps origin_x for subpixel raster phase.
- final glyph bitmap x now comes from layout-provided glyph.x when finite.
- raster metrics x_offset remains only as an invalid-layout fallback.
- draw/glyphs/tests.rs adds guards for layout bitmap-left authority and invalid-layout fallback.

